{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（3日）中午12時44分，警方接獲一名職員報案，指九龍城沙浦道30-38號有一名30多歲男工人懷疑工作期間，從10幾樓高棚架墮下昏迷。救援人員接報到場，發現事主仍困在外牆棚架，於是設法將他救下。警方將案件列作工業意外，正調查事故原因。</p><p>現場消息指，涉事大廈正在改建為香港學生公寓「一匯居· 啟德」。事發時任職安全經理的傷者與安全經理到13至14樓的天台巡查，期間墮下至3樓外牆棚架，消防員用1個多小時將傷者救上平台位置，傷者其後由救護車送往廣華醫院，送院時須使用自動心外壓機搶救。</p><p>此外，記者留意到3樓外牆棚架懷疑受傷者墮樓衝力壓毀，疑為傷者的安全帽被飛甩至毗鄰大廈。</p><p>據了解，傷者與妻子育有兩名年幼的子女。</p><figure><img alt=\"傷者獲救。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260803/1160952132262694912827913.jpeg/EUJ7EisIHVF1wFS4nnhq5-UjyO4OoO3VJsuJ0QPLidE\"/><figcaption>傷者獲救。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"傷者頭流血，被困外牆棚架，救援人員到場將他救下。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260803/1160943456223236096283671.jpeg/7gbw1Kq4c7xKo_j1Z2IA2Fd8DgzJoPBSK6kMLg6pDC4\"/><figcaption>傷者頭流血，被困外牆棚架，救援人員到場將他救下。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"疑為傷者的安全帽被飛甩至毗鄰大廈。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260803/1160955212916068352498713.jpeg/wAxDfyU8BH2NNUq0SBwT2v-aKWYBRXhVFU49KDBOPSg\"/><figcaption>疑為傷者的安全帽被飛甩至毗鄰大廈。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場是正在改建的香港學生公寓。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260803/1160952627815518208497806.jpeg/rd1_M1_Jsos2Sna-KeqB6itfs0mo5wmkh6bYo6Km2KM\"/><figcaption>現場是正在改建的香港學生公寓。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防員救出傷者。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260803/1160943850533949440635178.jpeg/nwY_p2LhgXDMwsOU6r_GCs3qjLorhZynn5u0drqbtHY\"/><figcaption>消防員救出傷者。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"傷者送院救治（鄭嘉惠攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260803/1160950555120635904023897.jpeg/tknCyJNDTH_EErDaJtYMey_TeeuTZK6w2bD6N_yw-jc\"/><figcaption>傷者送院救治（鄭嘉惠攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"傷者妻子登上警車。（鄭嘉惠攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260803/1160952633507450880762489.jpeg/il-4kAnJ_xBOu0YuxI_He4f4fhaoe-OU5vO_x8Pzv8c\"/><figcaption>傷者妻子登上警車。（鄭嘉惠攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"救援人員到場。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260803/1160940976089337856375921.jpeg/iWvJc2BsFeGF5PqRHIVaAQX3r8K2Q1lRCG9SGC1vUhg\"/><figcaption>救援人員到場。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防到場。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260803/1160940978916429824497615.jpeg/VcmXnD-Iln4x3kXpoFwliTqzjsVvaeaJdSmcF1ApnBc\"/><figcaption>消防到場。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警員到場調查。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260803/1160940981638664192284657.jpeg/viLCAVcoAaBw1FwutrdBG2LSJYbj3K4uOVxccRxcXHE\"/><figcaption>警員到場調查。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"工人在場了解。（鄭嘉惠攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260803/1160950552671031296894520.jpeg/C4jp7PTO5k-3QEyVv0FYxbKBsDsGmLqbP3t8dBp7fHQ\"/><figcaption>工人在場了解。（鄭嘉惠攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警員帶走傷者的鞋。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260803/1160952630801993728928413.jpeg/MqHG4vyIO0l9s_zSuRHF1SIb2jyDvgfASPPwom3z8KI\"/><figcaption>警員帶走傷者的鞋。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"涉事大廈正在改建為香港學生公寓「一匯居· 啟德」。（鄭嘉惠攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260803/1160955500116840448496317.jpeg/cIMYnzcCBFFiFpswseW9wa8bEvy9hSFWPGBxBhlgcQY\"/><figcaption>涉事大廈正在改建為香港學生公寓「一匯居· 啟德」。（鄭嘉惠攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-03T06:39:35.979331+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":541,"images":13,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}